        "original_id": "a06be054-6132-5917-bb29-45d4f8ecf9eb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amanda Posey, Finola Dwyer, Nick Hornby, John Crowley, Colm Tóibín, Saoirse Ronan, Emory Cohen, Domhnall Gleeson, Jim Broadbent, Julie Walters\n- Films: An Education, Brooklyn\n- Roles: film producer, novelist, screenwriter, director, cast\n- Topics: British cinema, literary adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Amanda Posey, born in June 1965, is a British film producer.\n- Amanda Posey is best known for the films An Education and Brooklyn.\n- Amanda Posey frequently collaborated with Finola Dwyer on producing films.\n- Amanda Posey is the wife of novelist and screenwriter Nick Hornby.\n- Colm Tóibín published the novel Brooklyn in 2009.\n- Brooklyn is a 2015 British-Canadian-Irish romantic drama film.\n- John Crowley directed the 2015 film Brooklyn, and Nick Hornby wrote its screenplay based on Colm Tóibín's 2009 novel.\n- The film Brooklyn stars Saoirse Ronan, Emory Cohen, Domhnall Gleeson, Jim Broadbent, and Julie Walters.",
